   templates cannot write pkg@version or user@host beside a value.
2. values.mjs:138 — parseRemote drops the port for https:// too: https://git.example.com:8443/team/app.git →
   REPO_URL https://git.example.com/team/app. Right for ssh, wrong for https.
3. template.mjs:252 — with the post-render scan gone, adjacent values make @@ in the output:
   render('@@A@@@@B@@', {A:'x@', B:'@y'}) → 'x@@y'; same with #each over ['a@','@b']. Breaks D2's leftover-@@ guarantee.
